# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
!coverage.go
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# Claude / AI assistant context — local only, never track
# (claude.md in lowercase too: patterns are case-sensitive on Linux)
CLAUDE.md
claude.md
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider*

# Design / implementation / planning docs — local only
/docs/
docs/*
*.design.md
*.implementation.md

# Local security scan output
scans/

# Build output
/dist/
/bin/
/build/

# Go
vendor/

# Frontend
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/.vite/
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Embedded UI build output (keep the placeholder so go:embed compiles)
internal/webui/dist/*
!internal/webui/dist/.gitkeep

# Local dev config / data
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
/data/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Editor / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Playwright output
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
web/*.tsbuildinfo
/cic
